STRUCTURE
/posts				<- with the posts and metadata files
	[post.html]	
	[metadata.meta]
/docs				<- example compile target
template.html
post.html

FOLDER SETTINGS:
	- TARGET: compile target
	- TEMPLATE: template for index file
	- POST: template for blogpost link in index

POST METADATA:
	- TEMPLATE: template file to build from
	- TITLE
	- SUBTITLE
	- DATE
	- SERIES (set 'none' if none)